
### admin role token
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/alibi/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=alibi-api&username=alibi.admin&password=alibi-admin

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### crew-manager role token
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/alibi/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=alibi-api&username=crew.manager&password=crew-manager

> {% client.global.set("manager_token", response.body.access_token); %}
